      "taskMessage": "<b>Michele:</b> Your record connects the authorization, public notice, DNS answer, and Zenmap result to the scanner finding. The Case Journal keeps those observations together, and the packet gate protects normal service while stopping suspicious traffic.\n\nBefore I send the final note, check the order of the work. The First Signal workflow in Cyberpedia explains how each step supports the next.",
